d 'ATIP_VOLCANO': module to plot outlier evidence vs. magnitude
d
d  atip_volcano draws a volcano-style scatter plot (magnitude on X,
d evidence on Y) from the output of atip_score, using the same
d visual language as an existing MMD volcano-plot command but
d without inventing a formal p-value, since the underlying rules
d are heuristic. Vertical jitter is applied because the evidence
d axis (0-5) is discrete. 
d
d KW: outliers
d KW: plot
d
d Requires: Stata version 14 
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260802
d
d Author: Andres Talavera Cuya,   Direccion Nacional de Censos y Encuestas -- INEI Peru
d Support: email talaveracuya@@gmail.com
d
f atip_volcano.ado
f atip_volcano.sthlp
